#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:111
#: 77dadb97f97e413098201ff5ee4d673c
msgid "Servo/Motor Outputs"
msgstr "舵机/电机输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:113
#: 9dc15dfeb50d4149b5c2275536b685d0
msgid ""
"All motor/servo outputs are Dshot and PWM capable. However, mixing Dshot, "
"serial LED, and normal PWM operation for outputs is restricted into groups, "
"ie. enabling Dshot for an output in a group requires that ALL outputs in "
"that group be configured and used as Dshot, rather than PWM outputs."
msgstr ""
"所有电机/舵机输出均支持 DShot 和 PWM。但是，混用 DShot、串行 LED 与普通 PWM 输出受组限制，即为某组中的某路输出启用 "
"DShot，则该组所有输出都必须配置并用作 DShot，而非 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:115
#: cfc634d7e302465182f5c2bbb89f2bf1
msgid "PWM 1,2 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、2 在第1组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:116
#: d5469b0e9f644b7684e0ed88f4897963
msgid "PWM 3,4 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3、4 在第2组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:117
#: 39fcb3f23dd1461cbfc9c8c8bb9abbe9
msgid "PWM 5-7 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 5–7 在第3组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:118
#: 0370d1dcc1764adfa226c5612d3e5ea5
msgid "PWM 8-10 in group4"
msgstr "PWM 8–10 在第4组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:119
#: 5dc909d6383e47f4b229403fac380a16
msgid ""
"PWM 11,12 in group5  Note: PWM12 is setup for serial LED use by default, if "
"PWM11 is used for motors or servos, you must re-assign PMW12 to a normal PWM"
" output or nothing"
msgstr ""
"PWM 11、12 在第5组。注意：PWM12 默认用于串行 LED，若 PWM11 用于电机或舵机，则必须将 PWM12 重新分配为普通 PWM "
"输出或不使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:122
#: 42e595479d284af29174fe5c4c5f885a
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:124
#: 2a77b0da83404e6ab8efcaa488121016
msgid ""
"The SBUS pin, is passed by an inverter to RX2 (UART2 RX), which by default "
"is mapped to a timer input instead of the UART, and can be used for all "
"ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which "
"require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, can provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"SBUS 引脚经反相器接入 RX2（UART2 RX），默认映射为定时器输入而非 UART，支持 ArduPilot 所有接收机协议，但 "
"CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 需要真实 UART 连接。然而，以此方式连接 FPort 时，可提供 RC 但不支持数传遥测。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:126
#: 741ffc73b87f4af69d177c116c0d5fb4
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, the UART1 should be used. With this option, "
":ref:`SERIAL11_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` must be set to \"23\" (already "
"set by default), and:"
msgstr ""
"要在 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中使用 CRSF 及内嵌数传，应使用 UART1。此时 "
":ref:`SERIAL11_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 必须设置为 「23」（已为默认值），且："

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:128
#: c3d14a3dbeae4095a1ae1ee24cf75dad
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:130
#: ec13fe72004d4161b07f502bfa460d98
msgid ""
"DSM/SRXL connects to the RX1  pin, but SBUS would still be connected to "
"SBUS."
msgstr "DSM/SRXL 连接 RX1 引脚，但 SBUS 仍连接至 SBUS 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:132
#: a3a264bbb0b44677a28fb8ad81c68e52
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to TX1 and RX1 via a bi-directional inverter. See "
":ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr "FPort 需通过双向反相器连接 TX1 和 RX1。参见 :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:134
#: c98e6a9cc9a94a08a8ea0e597fb41992
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX1 connection, in addition to RX1 and automatically "
"provides telemetry. ELRS is connected in the same way, but bit 13 of "
":ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` should be set."
msgstr ""
"CRSF 除 RX1 外还需连接 TX1，并自动提供数传遥测。ELRS 连接方式相同，但应设置 "
":ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` 的第13位。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:136
#: aa8e5656910040a89fa2d23e6adc0faa
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX1 and automatically provides telemetry.  "
"Set :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接 TX1 并自动提供数传遥测。将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:138
#: 5f1630385c0d49abbfc1f017879d5782
msgid ""
"UART1 is configured by default for serial receivers. You can also have more "
"than one receiver in the system at a time (usually used for long range hand-"
"offs to a remote TX). See :ref:`common-multiple-rx` for details."
msgstr ""
"UART1 默认配置用于串行接收机。系统中可同时使用多个接收机（通常用于远距离切换至远程发射机）。详情参见 :ref:`common-multiple-"
"rx`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:140
#: b65cad7966f244c194547694f84e6201
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM (SBUS requires external inversion "
"on other UARTs). See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""
"任意 UART 也可用于 ArduPilot 中的 RC 系统连接，兼容除 PPM 以外的所有协议（SBUS 在其他 UART "
"上需要外部反相器）。详情参见 :ref:`common-rc-systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:142
#: fd78eb67af6e4e819f9a84d8316206c1
msgid ""
"the \"4V5\" pin above the SBUS pin and the 4V5 pins in the GPS, Airspeed, "
"and Telem connectors are powered when USB is connected. Be careful not to "
"present too much load to the USB source or voltage droop may occur. All "
"other 5V pins are only powered when battery is present."
msgstr ""
"SBUS 引脚上方的 「4V5」 引脚以及 GPS、空速和数传连接器中的 4V5 引脚在 USB 连接时供电。注意不要给 USB "
"电源过多负载，否则可能出现电压跌落。其他所有 5V 引脚仅在连接电池时供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:145
#: 6f3dba8d9a104f86800105be7d07cf5b
msgid "WIFI"
msgstr "WIFI"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:147
#: bcbd62e6463c4d6394dabe02c1e4a21c
msgid ""
"The SpeedyBeeF405Wing has an integrated wireless module allowing connections"
" to GCS via WIFI. See the user manual for instructions. While BT is "
"advertised as an alternate mode, this has not been proven to work with all "
"BT dongles or cell-phones by ArduPilot. The WIFI mode has been tested with a"
" variety of systems, however. Be sure the :ref:`SERIAL6_BAUD<SERIAL6_BAUD>` "
"= 115 and that nothing is loading the TX6/RX6 pins which are connected to "
"the wireless module, by default.."
msgstr ""
"SpeedyBeeF405Wing 集成无线模块，允许通过 WIFI 连接到 GCS。详情请参见用户手册。虽然 BT 被宣传为备用模式，但 "
"ArduPilot 尚未证实其与所有 BT 适配器或手机兼容。WIFI 模式已在多种系统上测试通过。请确保 "
":ref:`SERIAL6_BAUD<SERIAL6_BAUD>` = 115，且默认情况下连接至无线模块的 TX6/RX6 引脚未被占用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:150
#: 549dadb51b2640c4b4537c3f95b06123
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:152
#: 85dfa14b810d4b2da557f55554acae89
msgid ""
"The SpeedyBeeF405Wing supports using its internal OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 "
"(MAX7456 driver). External OSD support such as DJI or DisplayPort is "
"supported using UART5 or any other free UART. See :ref:`common-msp-osd-"
"overview-4.2` for more info."
msgstr ""
"SpeedyBeeF405Wing 支持使用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）启用内部 OSD。外部 OSD 支持（如 DJI 或 "
"DisplayPort）可通过 UART5 或其他空闲 UART 实现。详情参见 :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:155
#: b9d8026556ad4b53a843e3a0a18d5aec
msgid "VTX Control"
msgstr "VTX 控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:157
#: e6aa4c34e50141f2940cdee493b80e8e
msgid ""
"UART5 TX is located in the Video Output connector to provide IRC Tramp or "
"Smart Audio control of video transmitters. See :ref:`common-vtx` for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"UART5 TX 位于视频输出连接器，用于通过 IRC Tramp 或 Smart Audio 控制图传。详情参见 :ref:`common-vtx`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:160
#: 75c145224f4a41d596768b009e39913c
msgid "VTX Power Control"
msgstr "VTX 电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:162
#: d45e243a93844b9883b6e4f145f43d3c
msgid ""
"GPIO 81 controls the VTX BEC output to pins marked \"9V\". Setting this GPIO"
" high removes voltage supply to pins."
msgstr "GPIO 81 控制标有 「9V」 引脚的 VTX BEC 输出。将此 GPIO 拉高将切断供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:164
#: 1a2df709bbb44180908a864c2a4c4c76
msgid ""
"Set a ``RELAYx_PIN`` to “81” to control the  switching. Then select an RC "
"channel for control (Chx) and set its ``RCx_OPTION`` to the appropriate "
"Relay (1-6) that you had set its pin parameter above."
msgstr ""
"将 ``RELAYx_PIN`` 设为 「81」 以控制开关切换。然后选择一个 RC 通道（Chx）进行控制，并将其 ``RCx_OPTION`` "
"设置为上方引脚参数所设置的相应继电器（1–6）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:166
#: 2b00006072cf499982509aae9de56c67
msgid "For example, use Channel 10 to control the switch using Relay 2:"
msgstr "例如，使用通道10通过继电器2控制开关："

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:168
#: 64705840b7314c2f966ecf89ab926e74
msgid ":ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>` = “81”"
msgstr ":ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>` = 「81」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:170
#: c0a5ce91d5764d8788023ec157ec98ab
msgid ":ref:`RC10_OPTION<RC10_OPTION>` = “34” (Relay2 Control)"
msgstr ":ref:`RC10_OPTION<RC10_OPTION>` = 「34」（继电器2控制）"

